From 0eafa2c5ebd4b2e837e4847bf5d8ba05736dc67e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yusheng Peng <jiusi0519@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 02:06:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] OpenHarmony port: rviz on GLES2/pbuffer-EGL OGRE

- rviz_ogre_vendor/rviz_assimp_vendor: skip the ament_vendor ExternalProject
  under OHOS_CROSS_BUILD, point extras at the prebuilt prefix install and
  replace find_package(OpenGL/X11) with direct EGL/GLESv2 find_library
- rviz_rendering: guard X11/GLX code with !defined(__OHOS__), load
  RenderSystem_GLES2, integrate OgreRTShaderSystem (RVizRTSSListener,
  ShaderGenerator init after the first dummy render window, RTShaderLib
  resources in the internal resource group)
- ogre_media/materials/glsles: GLSL ES 1.00 ports of the glsl120 shaders
  (unchanged program names, attach-free includes inlined)
